  "expirationDate": "2034-11-23",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300) #8462-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #10595, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14124, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34 (formerly Env-Sw 304.07) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300)",
